  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tPractice Management \n\t\tPractice Management Help Guide\n\n### Add a custom service\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Fri, 29 Nov, 2019 at  5:27 PM\n\n\t\tLocation: Practice Management module > Settings > Services\n\nRefer to the link\n\nHelp/Guide:\n\n• You can activate different types of services you are providing to your clients in the settings page for global services by using the toggles on the right [highlighted in the red box below].\n\n### Adding new custom service\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115348\">Practice Management </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188563\">Practice Management Help Guide</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Add a custom service\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Fri, 29 Nov, 2019 at  5:27 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Location: </span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Practice Management module &gt; Settings &gt; Services</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><a href=\"https://appv4.capium.com/#/home/settings-services\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Refer to the link</a><br><br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Help/Guide:</strong></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">• You can activate different types of services you are providing to your clients in the settings page for global services by using the toggles on the right [highlighted in the red box below].</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074259241/original/Ih3xjKU13Vh9KbDBBSy8m5totYZlL6zizw.png?1553623457\" width=\"496\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074259241/original/Ih3xjKU13Vh9KbDBBS